Kerjakan dulu bagian dalam kurung.

$$
\begin{aligned}
\frac25+\frac37&=\frac{14+15}{35}=\frac{29}{35}
\end{aligned}
$$

Kemudian:

$$
\begin{aligned}
55-\frac{29}{35}\times\frac{14}{1}&=55-\frac{58}{5} \\
&=55-11\frac35=44-\frac35=43\frac25
\end{aligned}
$$

Diketahui $125\%=\frac{125}{100}=\frac54$.

Maka:

$$
\begin{aligned}
\frac54+\frac23+\frac56-\frac4{12}&=\frac{15+8+10-4}{12} \\
&=\frac{29}{12}=2\frac5{12}
\end{aligned}
$$

$$
\begin{aligned}
X&=\frac34-\frac23=\frac{9-8}{12}=\frac1{12} \\
Y&=-\frac{14}{12}+\frac{12}{12}=-\frac2{12}
\end{aligned}
$$

Didapatkan $X>Y$. Namun hubungan itu tidak ada di opsi. Opsi D benar karena $-X=-\frac1{12}>-\frac2{12}=Y$.

Hubungan lama waktu penggunaan dengan bensin bersifat senilai (semakin lama digunakan, semakin banyak bensin yang dibutuhkan).

$$
\begin{aligned}
x&=\frac{25\times10}{4}=\frac{250}{4}=62{,}5\text{ liter} \\
\text{Tambahan bensin}&=62{,}5-25=37{,}5\text{ liter}
\end{aligned}
$$

$$
\begin{aligned}
\text{Kambing A per hari}&=\frac{60}{5}=12\text{ kg} \\
\text{Kambing B per hari}&=\frac{90}{6}=15\text{ kg} \\
\text{Makan bersama per hari}&=12+15=27\text{ kg} \\
\text{Dalam 2 hari}&=27\times2=54\text{ kg}
\end{aligned}
$$
